          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f001bac47799f469ba83f6194dfff8d625c7cb5c",
          "message": "docs: e-graph/VSA/NNUE review findings and literature survey (#1004)\n\nAdds `docs/plans/2026-08-17-egraph-vsa-nnue-research-notes.md`,\nrecording the full review of `pixelflow-search/src/nnue/` and a\nliterature sweep so the findings don't get lost:\n\n- **Review summary:** the only live path is the extraction head\n(`EdgeAccumulator` → `forward_expr_only` → value MLP); the\nGraphAccumulator/VSA/mask/policy surface is dead end-to-end. Four\nlive-path defects documented with file/line refs: the `w1[128..132]`\ntrain/serve slot collision (log-count scalars vs variance fractions),\nthe `from_arena_dedup` vs `from_dag_choices_with_variance` accumulator\nskew, embeddings that receive no gradient but still decay (eroding the\nlatency prior), and the non-incremental \"incremental\" extractor.\n- **Lineage:** HalfEP → factored embeddings, the GNN vision doc, and the\nremoved Python Causal Sequence Transformer critic — with the nuance that\nthe critic died for its RL estimator, not for teacher-student\ndistillation as such.\n- **VSA capacity analysis:** why K=32 bundles are learned multiplicative\nfeatures rather than symbolic memory, the depth-shift mod-K aliasing,\nand the unit-modulus (FHRR) upgrade path.\n- **Literature map (2021–2026):** SmoothE, e-boost, extraction\nNP-completeness, GRANITE/Ithemal + two-tier labels (llvm-mca/uiCA\npretrain → measured-ns fine-tune), Omelette, MCTS-GEB,\nsketch-/guided-/ML-guided equality saturation, Ruler — each mapped to\nthe component of this codebase it plugs into.\n- **Prioritized adoption plan** with explicit non-goals (no REINFORCE\nreturn, no growing the dead Phase-3 surface).\n\nDocs-only change; no code touched.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01MaT5hcmmBS3r8Xv63bYWGa\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01MaT5hcmmBS3r8Xv63bYWGa)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
